    "trigger": "Existing hosted first preparation: immediate registration and consecutive signing E2E, repeat-each 2, then repeat-each 1 after missing trace. One worker. Same frozen SDK and staging topology as the preceding alternating trial.",
    "selection": "Only full invocations with 48 successful boolean responses are included. No partial invocation is used.",
    "probeOrder": "For group 0..3 and repeat 0..2, visit arm (group + offset) % 4 for offset 0..3. Create four new objects per group. Recreate the stub for each call. Log header wait and total wait using the same Worker clock."
